The following figure shows the distribution of RRA score in the comparison ser LDL b rep 1,ser LDL b rep 2,ser LDL b rep 3,ser LDL b rep 4 vs ser LDL t rep 1,ser LDL t rep 2,ser LDL t rep 3,ser LDL t rep 4 neg., and the RRA scores of 10 genes.

